WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:03,140
Did you inflict the injury on this child's face?

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:04,260
I am her grandma

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,260
What happened to grandma if I hit her?

4
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:09,220
Whose grandma are you? Don’t forget that my eldest sister’s family has been with your old Li family.

5
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,220
It's totally irrelevant

6
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,140
police comrade

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:13,390
The thing is like this, so say

8
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:14,710
From a legal perspective

9
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:15,630
My eldest sister’s family and the Li family

10
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:16,670
There is no relationship anymore

11
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:18,750
People with no connection suddenly appear on the big show

12
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:20,390
He robbed several of our children and threatened them.

13
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:21,390
If you don't hand over all the money

14
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:22,430
Just beat them to death

15
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:24,030
In this case, we have a bad hand

16
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:26,190
It should be considered self-defense, right?

17
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,270
What is robbery?

18
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:28,670
Aren't they just two Tang Hu?

19
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:35,390
My two grandsons are still young. They are just children. What do they know? Our children are only six and eight years old. Zhang Jianguo. Are you trying to argue with them? Okay, shut up.

20
00:00:35,950 --> 00:00:41,390
It's too much. My own son was poisoned and he was so worried that he rushed home.

21
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,670
All the sons were kicked out

22
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:48,390
He also robs and beats people, and there is mud under the windows above his head. He is so evil. Let me tell you, this is the kind of person who opens his mouth and shuts up and calls others a white-eyed wolf.

23
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:51,550
He is the real ruthless person. The palms and backs of his hands are all flesh, even if a bowl of water is not level.

24
00:00:51,550 --> 00:01:06,860
But it can't be like this. Comrade policeman, he is just a child. What does he know about you, a grown man, who cares about children? Are you still testing people?

25
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:07,820
The Li family robbed first

26
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:10,460
He beat Li Suyuan again, but Zhang Jianguo's attack was really ruthless.

27
00:01:10,460 --> 00:01:14,360
Both parties have their own faults. I suggest that this matter be settled and the two parties should be separated.

28
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:18,120
You policeman and Comrade Zhang Jianguo, policeman Zhang Jianguo

29
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:31,350
Why don't you accompany Bi Sha and let's go and stop?

30
00:01:31,350 --> 00:01:33,190
Leave Tang Hu and our home behind

31
00:01:33,190 --> 00:01:40,280
The medical expenses in Song and Yuan Dynasties are not settled
